bel="8月7日周五，1 项日程" aria-pressed="false"><span>7</span><i aria-hidden="true"><b></b></i></button><button class="schedule-calendar-day outside has-events" type="button" aria-label="8月8日周六，1 项日程" aria-pressed="false"><span>8</span><i aria-hidden="true"><b></b></i></button><button class="schedule-calendar-day outside has-events" type="button" aria-label="8月9日周日，1 项日程" aria-pressed="false"><span>9</span><i aria-hidden="true"><b></b></i></button></div><footer class="schedule-calendar-legend"><span><i></i> 有日程</span><span>选择日期查看并管理当天安排</span></footer></div><aside class="schedule-agenda-pane" aria-label="所选日期的日程"><header class="schedule-agenda-header"><div><span>今天</span><strong>7月27日周一</strong></div><span class="schedule-agenda-count">2 项</span></header><div class="schedule-agenda-list"><article class="schedule-agenda-item"><div class="schedule-agenda-time"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock3"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16.5 12"></polyline></svg><strong>09:00</strong></div><div class="schedule-agenda-main"><div class="schedule-agenda-title"><strong>周一复盘</strong><span class="paused">已暂停</span></div><p>复盘本周目标</p><small>每周 · 09:00</small></div><div class="schedule-agenda-actions"><button class="button compact" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play"><polygon points="6 3 20 12 6 21 6 3"></polygon></svg>执行</button><button class="icon-action compact" type="button" aria-label="启用日程"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play"><po