exports[`personal schedule > renders the real empty schedule state 1`] = `"<section class="shell-view shell-page-view active" data-shell-view="schedule"><div class="page-stack schedule-page"><header class="schedule-header" aria-label="日程操作"><nav class="schedule-subnav" aria-label="日程筛选"><div class="catalog-mode-tabs" role="group" aria-label="日程范围"><button aria-pressed="true" class="filter-chip mode-tab active" data-filter="personal" type="button"><span>个人日程</span></button><button aria-pressed="false" class="filter-chip mode-tab" data-filter="teamflow" type="button"><span>小队日程</span></button></div><span class="schedule-nav-divider" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="catalog-mode-tabs" role="group" aria-label="查看内容"><button aria-pressed="true" class="filter-chip mode-tab active" data-filter="tasks" type="button"><span>日程</span></button><button aria-pressed="false" class="filter-chip mode-tab" data-filter="history" type="button"><span>执行记录</span></button></div></nav><div class="schedule-header-actions"><label class="catalog-search schedule-search"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg><input aria-label="搜索日程" placeholder="搜索日程或执行记录" value=""/></label><button class="icon-action schedule-refresh" type="button" disabled="" aria-label="刷新日程" title="刷新日程"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-refresh-cw"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1 6.74 2.74L21 8"></path><path d="M21 3v5h-5"></path><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 0 1-9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1-6.74-2.74L3 16"></path><path d="M8 16H3v5"></path></svg></button><button class="button primary" type="button" disabled=""><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg>新建日程</button></div></header><section class="schedule-summary" aria-label="日程概览"><article><span>已启用</span><strong>0</strong><small>按计划自动执行</small></article><article><span>执行中</span><strong>0</strong><small>同一日程不会重叠</small></article><article><span>失败</span><strong>0</strong><small>可在记录中追踪</small></article><article><span>下一次执行</span><strong class="schedule-next-run">—</strong><small>到时自动开始执行</small></article></section><div class="schedule-alert" role="status">CrewON Control 未连接，连接后可管理个人日程。</div><section class="schedule-calendar-shell" aria-label="日程日历"><div class="schedule-calendar-pane"><header class="schedule-calendar-toolbar"><div><span>日历</span><strong>2026年7月</strong></div><div class="schedule-calendar-controls"><button class="button compact" type="button">今天</button><button class="icon-action compact" type="button" aria-label="上个月"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-left"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"></path></svg></button><button class="icon-action compact" type="button" aria-label="下个月"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></button></div></header><div class="schedule-calendar-weekdays" aria-hidden="true"><span>周一</span><span>周二</span><span>周三</span><span>周四</span><span>周五</span><span>周六</span><span>周日</span></div><div class="schedule-calendar-grid"><button class="schedule-calendar-day outside" type="butt